      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode Thirteen of Kukhnya Season Six. Nikita proposes marriage to Katya, and she asks for time to think about her answer. Later at the apartment, Denis tells Kostya the news, and Kostya convinces him that Katya still loves Denis.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "katya",
      "t": "Мне надо хорошо подумать об этом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Это мне сегодня Настя рассказала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "denis",
      "t": "Теперь у нас точно всё кончено.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
